<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <%- include('../partials/header.ejs') %>
        <title>GTIA | Extracurricular Resources</title>
        <link href="../../assets/sun/css/style.css" rel="stylesheet" />
        <link href="../../assets/sun/css/resources.css" rel="stylesheet" />
</head>

<body>
    <%- include('../partials/navbar.ejs', { currentPage: 'extracurriculars' }) %>

        <div class="container py-5" id="extracurriculars">
            <h1 class="text-center">Extracurricular Resources</h1>

            <section class="pt-5">
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="pl-5">
                        <h3 class="color-dark-primary">What is the central resource to find all student
                            organizations at Tech?</h3>
                        <p class="color-dark-secondary pt-3">
                            Once admitted to Georgia Tech, you can find campus organizations by using <a
                                href="https://gatech.campuslabs.com/engage" class="color-primary"
                                target="_blank">Engage</a>. On the "Organizations" page, you can filter for
                            student
                            orgs by selecting "Registered Student Organizations" in the "Braches" field.
                        </p>
                        <p class="color-dark-secondary ">
                            Another great way to learn more about GT's student organizations is to check out
                            the
                            club tabling booths during FASET and the first week of classes in the Fall!
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
            <section class="pt-2">
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="pl-5">
                        <h3 class="color-dark-primary">What are some professional / major-related
                            extracurriculars
                            on campus?</h3>
                        <p class="color-dark-secondary pt-3">
                            There are many organizations that have an academic and/or professional focus.
                            These
                            organizations allow you to obtain valuable experience in an area you might want
                            to
                            work
                            in later on. Some notable ones include <a href="http://ewbgt.org/" class="color-primary"
                                target="_blank">Engineers Without Borders (EWB)</a>,
                            <a href="https://bitsofgood.org/" class="color-primary" target="_blank">Bits of
                                Good</a>, <a
                                href="http://www.undergradresearch.gatech.edu/content/undergraduate-research-ambassadors"
                                class="color-primary" target="_blank">Undergraduate Research Ambassadors
                                (URA)</a>,
                            <a href="https://gatech.campuslabs.com/engage/organization/consult-your-community"
                                class="color-primary" target="_blank">Consult Your Community (CYC)</a>, and
                            <a href="https://scc.gatech.edu/" class="color-primary" target="_blank">Student
                                Competition Center Teams</a>. However, there are many more that cater to a
                            very
                            wide
                            variety of interests.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
        </div>

        <%- include('../partials/footer.ejs') %>
</body>

</html>